{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2022-12-19 16:15:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE NAMED TO DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY INDEX FOR NINTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "MERRILLVILLE, IND. , DEC. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NISOURCE WAS NAMED TO THE DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY INDEX (DJSI) -\xa0NORTH AMERICA FOR THE NINTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR, IN RECOGNITION OF THE COMPANY'S LEADERSHIP IN SUSTAINABLE BUSINESS PRACTICES."}